

@ BEGIN PATCH (tools/hoenn_import/patches)
SlateportCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_RumorIntro::
    .string "I write down what the sailors say\n"
    .string "when they come ashore.\p"
    .string "Here's one going round the docks…$"

SlateportCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_Rumor0::
    .string "The champion of KANTO came in on\n"
    .string "the new airliner, they say.\p"
    .string "CAPTAIN STERN was down at the\n"
    .string "harbor waiting to shake a hand.$"

SlateportCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_Rumor1::
    .string "The OCEANIC MUSEUM has a survey of\n"
    .string "the sea floor upstairs.\p"
    .string "Someone's been asking after it\n"
    .string "who didn't come to see the fish.$"

SlateportCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_Rumor2::
    .string "AQUA, the men in the blue bandannas\n"
    .string "call themselves.\p"
    .string "They talk about the sea like it\n"
    .string "owes them something.$"

SlateportCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_Rumor3::
    .string "The GYM in DEWFORD TOWN is dark as\n"
    .string "a cave inside.\p"
    .string "BRAWLY trains where the waves come\n"
    .string "in hardest, so they tell me.$"

SlateportCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_Rumor4::
    .string "A quiet young man shut himself in\n"
    .string "GRANITE CAVE to study the rock.\p"
    .string "If you carry word down to him,\n"
    .string "carry a light as well.$"

SlateportCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_Rumor5::
    .string "The wreck out past ROUTE 108 still\n"
    .string "has its hold full.\p"
    .string "CAPTAIN STERN would pay well for\n"
    .string "the scanner that went down in it.$"

SlateportCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_Rumor6::
    .string "Three brothers in the house on\n"
    .string "ROUTE 109 battle whoever knocks.\p"
    .string "SODA POP for anyone who lasts\n"
    .string "through all three of them.$"

SlateportCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_Rumor7::
    .string "There's a man at the harbor who\n"
    .string "keeps HOENN's BADGE register.\p"
    .string "KANTO BADGES don't count here.\n"
    .string "You start again from nothing.$"

SlateportCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_Rumor8::
    .string "Wild POKéMON round SLATEPORT come\n"
    .string "up young. The sea keeps them so.\p"
    .string "The TRAINERS are another matter.\n"
    .string "They've been waiting for someone.$"

SlateportCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_Rumor9::
    .string "A PIKACHU riding on a shoulder\n"
    .string "turns heads in this city.\p"
    .string "The museum's current exhibit would\n"
    .string "dearly like to meet one.$"

SlateportCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_H0::
    .string "Advice, off a sailor?\p"
    .string "Don't build one POKéMON and hope.\n"
    .string "The sea doesn't care how strong\l"
    .string "your best one is if it's the wrong\l"
    .string "one for the weather.$"

SlateportCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_H1::
    .string "I trade with friends up and down\n"
    .string "the coast.\p"
    .string "When one arrives holding something\n"
    .string "as well, that's two presents at\l"
    .string "once, isn't it.$"
@ END PATCH
